#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:1
#: ecbc90b0c3214821972c1ad74f717518
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:3
#: 9f974c33e4ef4cd99181102260c6a834
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:5
#: 3a3ebf0916884b4d8759f6b3ebe46b77
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:7
#: 8e83b4ecff9b4d5a8bf2bd5286815b11
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:9
#: b61f4ff6de7e425c85e892e51ecbd938
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:11
#: 956c25951d324b1d9768eb800bec113c
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:13
#: 2c5d3b0356f1441ab63643f8f04a1205
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:14
#: 12036614322240d5b05d833eeb4b0c8f
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:15
#: 676c53fc59f646e7ab4198cfac5dcb40
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:16
#: 3a83fca89e724a8fa271bda6ddae1de4
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:17
#: cb3fff400006427e9412f85659bb4548
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:19
#: e6e98cac864f4f5e82427a39dbb64cff
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:21
#: 4458dad7d7444ada9b3fd7f918b9af4f
msgid ""
"The builder supports explanation and experimentation; generated structures "
"remain subject to code review and tests."
msgstr ""
"El constructor facilita la explicacion y la experimentacion; las estructuras"
" generadas siguen sujetas a revision de codigo y pruebas."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:23
#: 14a2eecb9f164e97a0175e17dc52dc6e
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:25
#: 326759a6f8bc4d5ca3a4aaaaaa5379f0
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:27
#: bc7126a0ff6745769b66a20bbf688338
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/operations.md:29
#: a049a7f3ca5549fe99e194b7573fb996
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `1.0.0` with status `in-"
"development`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `1.0.0` con el estado `in-"
"development`. Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version "
"para conocer los cambios."
